  "note": "3B: the original catalogue. Guest rooms carry the April-2010 coin table (3,000/8,500/23,000/45,500 at L1/2/14/32, income=XP=1/3/7/10, stays 2-4 min) on the existing ids — the ID is internal, the display name is i18n, so economy IS the Budget Room and art and saves survive. The five premium rooms are gem-priced (6/12/15/20/22) with the original coin payouts (12/24/24/42/32; the non-monotone Large-vs-Presidential pair is faithful). Amenities carry table A.2; `spa` is the Disco by display name (id kept for saves/art; the redraw belongs to the art phase). 4B: cafe, arcade and the disco run WITHOUT staff, exactly as the original listed them; every other slot is covered by the temp model (see staff.json). laundry/staffRoom/maintenance/business are PARKED at level 53 (decision 11a): schema-valid, beyond the 52-level game, exempt from the level table by validator convention."
